# royal-potter — Overview

Royal Potter (working title; Codex's top name pick is "Kiln & Keep") is Luqman's solo
entry for the Slapjam 2026 AI game jam (https://itch.io/jam/slapjam-ai-1), theme
**Castles**. It is a calm, funny pottery game for phones: you are the royal potter, castle
folk order towers (watchtower, keep, turret, onion dome, spire, gatehouse), you throw each
one on a potter's wheel with your thumb, glaze and fire it, and the castle grows out of
your pottery over one day. The last customer is a dragon. Clay can collapse ("sploosh")
for laughs; there is no game over.

